                                "sense_id": "9406a72d-e2e6-35d0-906e-123601d3ffcd",
                                "text": "notwithstanding being (as he saith) counselled by a friend of his, at that instant, to kill himselfe, it fell out well for him to opinionate himselfe [translating s'opiniatrer] yet in hope[…]."
                            },
